**Subject:** Your WellPeps receipt: {{price}} on {{charge_date}}
Hi {{first_name}},
We charged {{price}} to your {{card_brand}} ending in {{card_last4}} for your {{plan_name}}. Your next charge is {{next_charge_date}}.
To avoid the next charge, cancel at least [72 hours] before that date: {{cancel_link}}, or write to support@wellpeps.com. Full policy: {{policy_link}}

**Subject:** Your WellPeps plan renews on {{renewal_date}}
Hi {{first_name}},
This is a reminder that your {{plan_name}} renews automatically on {{renewal_date}}. We will charge {{price}} to your {{card_brand}} ending in {{card_last4}}.
To avoid this charge, cancel by {{cancel_by_date}}: {{cancel_link}}. You can also reply to this email or write to support@wellpeps.com. Cancelling stops all future charges. If you cancel after {{cancel_by_date}} we still stop future charges, and we refund this charge if the pharmacy has not started preparing your medication.
If you take a prescribed medicine, talk to your clinician in the patient portal before you stop it.
Questions? support@wellpeps.com. Full policy: {{policy_link}}

**Subject:** Your WellPeps refund of {{refund_amount}}
Hi {{first_name}},
We issued a refund of {{refund_amount}} on {{refund_date}} to your {{card_brand}} ending in {{card_last4}}. Reason: {{refund_reason}}. Reference number: {{reference_number}}.
Refunds usually appear within [5 to 10 business days], depending on your bank or card issuer. You do not need to do anything. If you do not see it after that time, write to support@wellpeps.com and give us the reference number.
Full policy: {{policy_link}}
